{"3144230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Modern Warships", "steam_appid": 3144230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4584640, 4584650, 4584660, 4584670, 4584680, 4584690], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144230/extras/f580426b2467807cff0f27c429a91726.poster.avif?t=1780581117\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144230/extras/f580426b2467807cff0f27c429a91726.webm?t=1780581117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE DYNAMIC ACTION GAME ABOUT COMBAT VEHICLES OF PRESENT AND FUTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern Warships is a cross-platform arcade online action game where modern naval battles look like they do in reality. Surveillance aircraft rush forward to detect the enemy from distance, cruisers launch volleys of guided missiles and try to reset enemy missile defences, submarines sneak up to surface vessels and jet fighters provide cover to the allied fleet from the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MODERN WARFARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144230/extras/9117dd2f8bf9fcf8440a80a7cbe23af5.poster.avif?t=1780581117\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144230/extras/9117dd2f8bf9fcf8440a80a7cbe23af5.webm?t=1780581117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in modern naval and air battles with combat vehicles that perform the way they would do in reality. With drones and precise weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALL THE TOP VEHICLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144230/extras/c759a3b8026e2134926a338cd78f66b3.poster.avif?t=1780581117\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144230/extras/c759a3b8026e2134926a338cd78f66b3.webm?t=1780581117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ types of modern and prospective ships and aircraft including carriers, submarines, drones, stealth fighters and strategic bombers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC AND PRACTICAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144230/extras/8ea4f6f1f5b876a66353f1b77096faea.poster.avif?t=1780581117\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144230/extras/8ea4f6f1f5b876a66353f1b77096faea.webm?t=1780581117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play comfortably thanks to simple controls and arcade battle mode, switch smoothly between different types of vehicles during the same battle. Be in the most fun parts of battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DO IT YOURSELF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the potent customization system that allows you to change and modify almost all components of ships and aircraft. Bring the full power of supersonic missiles down on your enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAME NEVER FAILS TO IMPRESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144230/extras/ced23d5e3f3978f1a8a4b7a02b71a672.poster.avif?t=1780581117\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144230/extras/ced23d5e3f3978f1a8a4b7a02b71a672.webm?t=1780581117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern Warships regularly receives new battle maps, combat vehicles and weapons while in-game tournaments, events and other activities provide new gaming experience and cover the subject of modern naval and air battles from different perspectives.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144230/extras/f580426b2467807cff0f27c429a91726.poster.avif?t=1780581117\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144230/extras/f580426b2467807cff0f27c429a91726.webm?t=1780581117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE DYNAMIC ACTION GAME ABOUT COMBAT VEHICLES OF PRESENT AND FUTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern Warships is a cross-platform arcade online action game where modern naval battles look like they do in reality. Surveillance aircraft rush forward to detect the enemy from distance, cruisers launch volleys of guided missiles and try to reset enemy missile defences, submarines sneak up to surface vessels and jet fighters provide cover to the allied fleet from the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MODERN WARFARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cla